  "body": "Motivated Vendor - get in now before summer so you can enjoy your new pool. \r\n\r\n**contact for a private inspection 7 days a week**\r\n\r\n3 double rooms | 2.5 bath | 2 living | 3 outdoor living | Pool | Open plan kitchen and dining | 9.5 year Masterbuild guarantee | Sea views \r\n\r\nWe’ve made the decision to sell this beautiful home at 35 Kikorangi Drive, Ara Hills, as we look ahead to the next 12–18 months and where we want to be.\r\n\r\nBuilt specifically for us, this home was completed with quality, functionality and design at the forefront. No expense has been spared, with premium finishes, carefully considered details and an impressive list of features throughout. The property is also backed by approximately 9.5 years remaining on its Master Build Guarantee.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, the home makes an impression. Immaculate landscaping and a fully gated entrance provide a sense of privacy and exclusivity, while the thoughtfully designed interiors deliver modern living at its best.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen features fully integrated Fisher & Paykel appliances, complemented by high-end gunmetal fixtures and fittings, premium finishes and all the modern conveniences you would expect from a home of this calibre. Split-system air conditioning provides year-round comfort, while an integrated wine fridge adds another touch of luxury.\r\n\r\nOutside, a beautiful six-metre swimming pool creates the perfect setting for summer, complete with an outdoor shower for added convenience. With three separate outdoor living areas, there is plenty of room to entertain, relax or simply enjoy your own space.\r\n\r\nThe home offers three generous double bedrooms, including a master suite occupying its own upper-level wing. Complete with a walk-in wardrobe and ensuite, the master enjoys an added sense of separation from the downstairs bedrooms — ideal for families wanting their own space. Two separate living areas provide further flexibility for family life, entertaining and relaxation.\r\n\r\nElevated to capture beautiful beach views, the upper deck offers glimpses across the Hibiscus Coast, creating a wonderful backdrop to everyday living.\r\n\r\nLocated within the sought-after Ara Hills community, the property is fully electric, with no gas connection, offering a streamlined and modern approach to home living.\r\n\r\nDesigner finishes, thoughtful functionality and room for the whole family — all in one exceptional home.\r\n\r\n35 Kikorangi Drive is a home we built for ourselves, with quality and attention to detail at every turn. Now, as our plans evolve, it’s time for another family to enjoy everything this special property has to offer.\r\n\r\nGet in touch to arrange a viewing and experience it for yourself.\r\n\r\nPlease note - CV is based on 2024 estimates and the property was not built then. There is a current registered valuation which supports the sale price. \r\n\r\nI am selling the home on behalf of the vendor (I am not an agent). Please get in touch.",
